==============================================================================
spectral form on T^3_L x R:  C_L(tau) = (1/L^3) sum_{k != 0} e^{-|k| tau}/(2|k|),  |k|=2 pi |n|/L
lowest atoms: 6 modes |k|=2 pi/L  =>  f1^2(L) = 6 * (1/L^3) * 1/(2*2pi/L)
           f1^2(L) = 3/(2 pi) L^{-2} = 0.477465 * L^{-2}   -> 0
=> free field is CLASS 1 (critical / no O(1) atom), NOT class 3.

